     "text": "Thanks, Wren.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "landmarks": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "There's a gazebo where the moon comes down to rest. A tower crowned with a crescent. A mushroom house frozen into the ice. And an airship that never quite lands.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.wren.landmarks_0",
     "ticks": 234,
     "beats": [
      20,
      1040,
      2050,
      3370,
      4390,
      5720,
      6730,
      7750,
      9080,
      10140,
      11160
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Each has a keeper, and a waystone. Touch it, and you can come back whenever you like. It's the closest thing to cheating the Guild allows.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.wren.landmarks_1",
     "ticks": 174,
     "beats": [
      30,
      760,
      1560,
      2600,
      3490,
      4220,
      4950,
      6000,
      6730,
      7460,
      8180
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Mark the nearest one.",
     "go": "marked",
     "do": [
      "mark:landmark"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "edges_offer": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You've got good boots and a curious face. How'd you like to do some real surveying? The Guild pays, and I pay better.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.wren.edges_offer_0",
     "ticks": 164,
     "beats": [
      30,
      750,
      1460,
      2180,
      3140,
      3820,
      4510,
      5190,
      6210,
      7030,
      7710
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Take this sextant. Find three landmarks, stand by their waystones and take a sighting. The trick is the wind. Hold your breath, and wait for the needle to settle.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.wren.edges_offer_1",
     "ticks": 215,
     "beats": [
      30,
      930,
      2120,
      3050,
      3940,
      4840,
      6040,
      6970,
      8170,
      9380,
      10270
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Bring me three good sightings and I'll give you something that makes the whole world smaller. Well. Easier to fall off.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.wren.edges_offer_2",
     "ticks": 159,
     "cue": "laughs",
     "beats": [
      30,
      700,
      1360,
      2210,
      2880,
      3560,
      4240,
      5230,
      5910,
      6710,
      7390
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "I'll take it.",
     "go": "#end",
     "do": [
      "side:edges:start",
      "give:afterworld:survey_sextant"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Maybe later.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "edges_progress": {
   "lines": [
